The Unicode license text accompanies both Cargo packages.

Current-data selection uses CLDR coverage, script, validity, alias, and currency
metadata under the Unicode license, plus current ISO 4217 code facts published
by SIX. Retrieval dates, releases, URLs, and checksums are recorded in
data/current/provenance.json in the repository.

Common measurement-unit identifiers, categories, and English display names derive
from CLDR validity data and the English locale. The complete pinned upstream inputs
and checksums are provided under data/current; generated Cargo packages contain
the selected catalog. ICU4X compiled conversion data supplies conversion factors,
temperature offsets, and reciprocal rules when unit-conversion is enabled.
